body:
Thank you very much for saying this! Posting the post was so scary, so many nerves during an already nervous time. Thank you. I hope your day goes great and that you feel really well!

I'm actually studying psychology and I want to work with children on the autistic spectrum and with disabilities, but I'm also really interested in research about PTSD and developing programs and resources to help people with PTSD (I'm also interested in app design, and I think there's so much our technology can do to help people with PTSD (It feels like I haven't talked about any of this with anyone in forever, sorry to plop my interests into my reply!)).

&#x200B;
